ns, shops, a pharmacy LIFE Pharmacy and various restaurants and cafes nearby.Al Mahra Residence is favorably located near Abu Dhabi International Airport and major thoroughfares, providing convenient transport accessibility. Attractions such as Yas Island and Saadiyat Island are 20-30 minutes away, making life at Al Mahra Residence surprisingly convenient and comfortable.","price":1670600,"title":"Al Mahra Residence","bitrix":{"id":868,"pf_id":"are.2.10575","source":null,"project_id":"Al Mahra Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Al Mahra Residence","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Siadah Development","project_location":"Masdar City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/237/images/2024/04/05/340x252/CcQqkCxYOSuXiP1VphQmkU1F9LIDFN8NCqKSZSLi.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/237/images/2024/04/05/464x312/CcQqkCxYOSuXiP1VphQmkU1F9LIDFN8NCqKSZSLi.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":24.4328549,"lng":54.6212467},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/237/images/2024/04/05/340x252/gsFdLeCtR1lLp0yGRd1GvYVqbJ1SGANFYfgbfRm5.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/237/images/2024/04/05/464x312/gsFdLeCtR1lLp0yGRd1GvYVqbJ1SGANFYfgbfRm5.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/237/images/2024/04/05/340x252/NFxjzJdTQYF6k5T6PNsLxXbAY1mtaXegByVEm9v1.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/237/images/2024/04/05/464x312/NFxjzJdTQYF6k5T6PNsLxXbAY1mtaXegByVEm9v1.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/237/images/2024/04/05/340x252/pDJQt9n0XOYFt5eM6GyBTcuTi4hjojtxW96PVFya.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/237/images/2024/04/05/464x312/pDJQt9n0XOYFt5eM6GyBTcuTi4hjojtxW96PVFya.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/237/images/2024/04/05/340x252/CcQqkCxYOSuXiP1VphQmkU1F9L